  Description: "COMPANION / COMMON / 1 STAR\r\nTALENT\nThis ally fires 2 extra projectiles,
    up to 10 total, and its weapon damage is multiplied by 0.65. Extra projectiles
    require a projectile weapon to fire normally.\r\n\nSUPPORT WHILE OWNED\nRun /
    Recruit discount: +2.5%\nChampion / Maximum health: -1\nTier 1/2/3 traits \xD71/2/4;
    merging three units reduces support sources.\n\r\n\nLIFE IN THE WAITING REALM\nA
    coastal courier carrying unsent replies as carefully as delivered letters. One
    envelope bears the protagonist's childhood handwriting; its reply was intercepted.
    They want the addressee to read it before being told what it means.\r\nPERSONAL
    PASSIVE\nEvery 4s in combat, attempt to heal the hero for 1.5 HP before healing
    modifiers. Healing restrictions apply.\r\n\nNamed talents count bodies and absorbed
    memories; their stated percentages are not multiplied by star level unless explicitly
    stated. Listed support modifiers scale separately at 1/2/4.\r\nBonds: tidal,
    ball. Immortal. Weapon rolls on recruitment; two equal-species/equal-star bodies
    merge unless the talent forbids it."
